## Coding Standards

### PHP
- WordPress Coding Standards via PHPCS, zero errors
- PHPStan level {{PHPSTAN_LEVEL}} with WordPress stubs
- `defined( 'ABSPATH' ) || exit;` in every directly reachable file
- Late escaping, early sanitizing, `$wpdb->prepare()`

### JavaScript
- `@wordpress/eslint-plugin` through `wp-scripts lint-js`
- `@wordpress/*` packages as externals
- Strings through `@wordpress/i18n`

### Security
- Capability check and nonce on every state change
- `permission_callback` on every REST route, never `__return_true` for writes
- No `unserialize()` on user data

